# Keep CLI uploads small — Vercel only builds apps/web (+ packages/*).
# Everything below is irrelevant to the web build or is reinstalled/rebuilt
# on Vercel, and was bloating the upload to ~2GB.
**/node_modules
apps/mobile
apps/desktop
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.zip
**/*.log
**/*.ipa
android
